(2. Proposed Methodology and Architecture:) Tj
0 -18 Td (The DRA architecture introduces three core stages:) Tj
0 -18 Td (1. Multi-Resolution Feature Pyramid Decomposition: The input tensor is decomposed into four stages.) Tj
0 -18 Td (2. Cross-Scale Residual Gating: Each stage communicates through a bidirectional residual highway) Tj
0 -18 Td (transferring high-frequency gradient signals to coarser semantic levels.) Tj
0 -18 Td (3. Decoupled Spatial-Channel Attention Modules: We decouple spatial attention computation) Tj
0 -18 Td (from channel pooling, reducing complexity from O[N^2] to O[N].) Tj
0 -18 Td (We formulate the attention gating mechanism as:) Tj
0 -18 Td (A[X] = sigma[ W2 * GELU[ W1 * Pool[X] ] ]) Tj
0 -18 Td (where X represents the input feature tensor, W1 and W2 denote down-projection and up-projection) Tj
0 -18 Td (parameter matrices, and sigma denotes the sigmoid gating function. This formulation ensures that) Tj
0 -18 Td (high-resolution spatial details are retained across all convolutional stages.) Tj
ET
endstream
